# Step 2: Join the White Rhinos

@left

{table-style=matrix-lower table-group=rhino-three padding="3pt 2pt" font-size=22pt}
| [ ]{text-align=center} | [N.Wh.]{background-color=#F0B8FF text-align=center} | [S.Wh.]{background-color=#F0B8FF text-align=center} | [Blk.R]{text-align=center} |
